%% Every node shape and link kind Mermaid flowcharts offer
flowchart LR
    start((Start)) --> input[/Read config file/]
    input --> parse[[parseConfig]]
    parse --> valid{Valid?}
    valid -- no --> err>Report error]
    err ==> stop(((Stop)))
    valid -- yes --> prep{{Prepare workers}}
    prep --> cache[(Redis cache)]
    prep --> queue[\Job queue\]
    queue --> manual[/Manual review\]
    cache -.-> run(Run jobs)
    manual --> run
    run --> report[\Write report/]
    report --o archive([Archive])
    report --x purge[Purge temp files]
    run <--> monitor["Monitor (Grafana)"]
